<title>FINLAND: Foreign ownership in Finnish companies flat in Apr.</title>
<headline>Foreign ownership in Finnish companies flat in Apr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign ownership of Finnish firms registered in the Central Securities Depository (FCSD) was unchanged at 28.1 percent of shares at end-April compared to end-March, FCSD said in a review received on Friday.</p>
<p>Foreign ownership in telecoms group Nokia rose to 73.1 percent at end-April from 72.06 percent a month earlier FCSD said.</p>
<p>Foreign ownership in construction materials and cargo handling equipment group Partek fell sharply, to 5.55 percent from 32.83 percent, primarily since Norwegian Aker's holding fell to nil from 26 percent as Partek merged with Sisu.</p>
